{"seq":34,"slug":"behavioral-economics-applications","title":"行为经济学应用","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"行为经济学应用\">行为经济学应用</h1><p>行为经济学（Behavioral Economics）是经济学与认知心理学的交叉领域，它系统研究人类决策在现实中如何偏离新古典理论所假设的&quot;理性人&quot;模型，并将这些偏离规律转化为可落地的设计工具。本 hub 的焦点是<strong>应用</strong>：从 Kahneman/Tversky 的前景理论到 Thaler/Sunstein 的助推框架，再到产品定价、金融科技、公共政策与实验设计——每一章都指向&quot;知道了偏误之后，能做什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位\">本 Hub 的定位</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>应用层</strong>，从三个角度切入：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>认知机制</strong>：偏误从何而来，人脑怎样构建判断（第 1 章 — 基础理论）</li>\n<li><strong>设计工具</strong>：如何通过选择架构、默认值与社会规范改变行为（第 2 章 — 助推）</li>\n<li><strong>场景实践</strong>：定价心理学、金融科技行为设计、政策助推的实际案例（第 3 章 — 应用）</li>\n<li><strong>方法论</strong>：怎样设计严谨的行为实验并守住伦理底线（第 4 章 — 方法）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的边界\">与兄弟 Hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 与 economics-finance category 内几个相邻 hub 有内容交汇，边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相邻 Hub</th>\n<th>与本 Hub 的区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>01_economics-thinking</strong>（博弈论等基础）</td>\n<td>提供标准理性人假设与博弈均衡的理论地基；本 hub 从&quot;人如何偏离此地基&quot;出发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>行为经济学基础理论</strong>（若存在于其他 category）</td>\n<td>理论推导与数学模型；本 hub 侧重落地应用与案例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>20_econometrics</strong></td>\n<td>提供因果推断工具（DID/IV）；本 hub 调用这些工具做行为实验设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节导览\">章节导览</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1_foundations      → 前景理论 / 有限理性 / 启发式与偏误（理论根基）&#10;2_nudge            → 选择架构 / 默认值与框架 / 社会规范与承诺（设计工具箱）&#10;3_applications     → 定价心理学 / 金融科技行为设计 / 公共政策助推（实战场景）&#10;4_methodology      → 实验设计 / 实地实验与 RCT / 伦理与操纵边界（研究方法）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1_foundations      → 前景理论 / 有限理性 / 启发式与偏误（理论根基）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2_nudge            → 选择架构 / 默认值与框架 / 社会规范与承诺（设计工具箱）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3_applications     → 定价心理学 / 金融科技行为设计 / 公共政策助推（实战场景）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4_methodology      → 实验设计 / 实地实验与 RCT / 伦理与操纵边界（研究方法）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"学习路径建议\">学习路径建议</h2><p>对于初学者，建议按章节顺序阅读：先理解偏误的认知根源（第 1 章），再掌握助推工具（第 2 章），然后结合具体场景（第 3 章），最后学会自己设计实验验证假设（第 4 章）。</p>\n<p>对于已有心理学背景的读者，可直接从第 2 章切入，聚焦 EAST 框架与助推设计的操作细节。</p>\n<p>对于数据科学与产品从业者，第 3 章与第 4 章最具直接价值——定价实验、A/B 测试的行为解读、以及如何规避 dark pattern 的伦理风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>01_economics-thinking</strong>（本 category）：博弈论基础、纳什均衡、机制设计——与本 hub 的助推设计形成互补视角</li>\n<li><strong>20_econometrics</strong>（本 category）：DID、IV、面板数据——为本 hub 第 4 章的实验设计提供计量工具</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第一章：行为经济学基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论与价值函数：行为经济学的核心模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/prospect-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounded-rationality","title":"有限理性与生态理性：人脑的决策经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/bounded-rationality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"heuristics-and-biases","title":"启发式与认知偏误：系统化的判断偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/heuristics-and-biases"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"nudge","title":"第二章：助推与选择架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/nudge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"choice-architecture","title":"选择架构：呈现方式如何决定决策结果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/nudge/choice-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"defaults-and-framing","title":"默认值与框架效应：最强大的两个助推工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/nudge/defaults-and-framing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-norms-and-commitment","title":"社会规范与承诺机制：利用社会压力与自我约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/nudge/social-norms-and-commitment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"第三章：行为经济学的落地应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-pricing-psychology","title":"产品定价心理学：价格感知与定价策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/applications/product-pricing-psychology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fintech-behavioral-design","title":"金融科技行为设计：用行为经济学重塑个人金融","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/applications/fintech-behavioral-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-policy-nudge","title":"公共政策助推：政府的行为洞察实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/applications/public-policy-nudge"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"methodology","title":"第四章：行为实验方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"behavioral-experiment-design","title":"行为实验设计：从问题到可测量假说","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/behavioral-experiment-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"field-experiments-rct","title":"实地实验与 RCT：行为干预评估的黄金标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/field-experiments-rct"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-and-manipulation","title":"伦理与操纵边界：助推与 Dark Pattern 的分界线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/methodology/ethics-and-manipulation"}]}]}